Finished in gunmetal grey and silver armor plating, "Southpaw" is defined by its distinct asymmetrical build: its entire left arm is fitted with a massive, extended mechanical power claw and hydraulic pincer. Tony designed this reinforced arm to pry open collapsed building structures, lift heavy wreckage, or create breaches without straining the main chassis.

In Iron Man 3, Mark XXXIV deploys with the rest of the Iron Legion during the House Party Protocol at the Norco oil rig, engaging Extremis forces in close-quarters combat before being destroyed in the final "Clean Slate" detonation order.
